<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 614.65, up 3.90.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 333 to 205.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 29,287,190 compared with 21,571,500 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
</text>
